♫What does that mean?♫

10
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,960
[Present]
♫What does that mean?♫

11
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:27,200
♫Whatever I say upset you, but you’ll get mad if I keep quiet♫

12
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,640
♫I really don’t know what to do♫

13
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:35,640
♫When deep down, I really like you♫

14
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:40,440
♫But you probably don’t care♫

15
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:43,480
♫Should I just say it out loud?♫

16
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:46,920
♫Or keep it all to myself and let it be?♫

17
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,320
♫What should I do?♫

18
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:54,120
♫I don’t know how to tell you how I feel♫

19
00:00:54,120 --> 00:01:00,160
♫I’m still confused by the way you react when I’m around♫

20
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:05,440
♫I’m still afraid. Will it be all right if I say it?♫

21
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:08,560
♫So I have to hide it inside♫

22
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:13,440
♫I don’t know what to do with these feelings♫

23
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:19,800
♫Always keep dreaming of you, night after night♫

24
00:01:20,039 --> 00:01:24,640
♫What should I do? I can’t just let it go on like this♫

25
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:30,720
♫But I’m too afraid to say it, so I’ll just keep it to myself♫

26
00:01:32,479 --> 00:01:35,560
Flaming Chains of Love

27
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:38,840
[Previously]
My friend and her daughter are here to visit me, so I want to take them to see the cave in the mine.

28
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:40,840
But aren’t you afraid of the dark and narrow space, Miss Phrao?

29
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:42,640
Miss Panee did it on purpose.

30
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:44,039
My diamond ring is gone!

31
00:01:44,039 --> 00:01:47,600
This is all your fault. You must go in there and find it.

32
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:50,320
Help!

33
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:52,479
Kaphrao!

34
00:01:52,479 --> 00:01:53,840
Let’s hurry and get out of here.

35
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,800
The heavy rain has caused a landslide, Master.

36
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:57,840
This is all because of you!

37
00:01:58,479 --> 00:02:00,240
Fai!

38
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:01,600
Get out of Fai’s life now!

39
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:02,440
- Aunt Nee!
- Get out!

40
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:05,680
Ak, your daughter is protecting your mistress’s child.

41
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:09,000
Kaphrao is the daughter of someone I’m indebted to. He died for me.

42
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:11,240
Your dad had sacrificed his life for my dad.

43
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:13,760
But I still let Aunt Nee hurt you.

44
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:15,680
You did protect me today.

45
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:35,280
Maybe we should make a horse stable on the edge of our farm, what do you think?

46
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:38,760
That’s great. And it’d be nice to have a duck farm too.

47
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:39,600
Ducks?

48
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,000
Din!

49
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,640
Miss you so much!

50
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,880
How’s the drive? Tired?

51
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:50,280
Not really.

52
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,400
Believe me?

53
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:53,680
No.

54
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:56,400
Hello.

55
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,840
- Hello.
- Hello.

56
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,320
Hello.

57
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:03,800
Look, next time, try to plan beforehand where you’re going.

58
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:08,000
You’re lucky you called first. Otherwise, you would’ve gone north for nothing.

59
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:13,000
I didn’t expect we’d end up here too.

60
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,280
Who would’ve known you’d be here?

61
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:18,000
By the way, Din,

62
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:22,079
can I borrow your clothes? We didn’t get to stop by anywhere.

63
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:25,840
Sure. And if you need more, you can go buy new ones.

64
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:28,960
Kaphrao can borrow Rose’s clothes.

65
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,040
Thank you so much.

66
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:32,880
No problem.

67
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:37,640
As for your room, it’s already taken care of. It’s right next to mine.

68
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:44,120
I’ll take Miss Phrao to her room first, so she can freshen up and get changed.

69
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:47,079
I’ll leave her to you then, Boss Rose.

70
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:49,000
I need to talk to Din for a bit.

71
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,200
Don’t worry.

72
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:51,680
Let’s go then.

73
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,200
Come.

74
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:01,560
What’s up, kiddo?

75
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,920
Got a problem.

76
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,680
You only come to me when there’s a problem.

77
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:09,520
It’s bad.

78
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:10,200
Really?

79
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:24,400
You and Fai can stay in this room.

80
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,520
Can you two sleep in the same room?

81
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,600
Yes.

82
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,800
I’ll go bring you some clothes.

83
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:34,920
If you need anything, you can always let me know.

84
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:37,680
Thank you so much, Miss Rose.

85
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,800
What happened?

86
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:58,000
Just some sort of family conflict.

87
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,800
Do you want to tell me about it?

88
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:11,480
I’m always here to listen.

89
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:22,080
And that’s what happened.

90
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:27,760
So, I figured we shouldn’t go home now–don’t want to make it worse.

91
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,240
Just came here to catch our breath first.

92
00:05:32,280 --> 00:05:36,159
You did the right thing. Staying there would only add fuel to the fire.

93
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,800
Aunt Nee is probably so mad at me right now.

94
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:47,880
Obviously, you went against her to protect Phrao like that.

95
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:58,800
Is this the first time you had a row with Aunt Panee?

96
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:12,880
So, have you realised now that you like her?

97
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:22,640
Yes, I like Phrao.

98
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:36,920
If she’s the one for you, then don’t ever let her go again.

99
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:53,200
We’re with Din now, Dad.

100
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:56,840
Please don’t worry.

101
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:00,200
Yes.

102
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,880
Please take care of Aunt Nee for me.

103
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:15,720
I’m a bit worried about Miss Panee though.

104
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:30,080
Whose number is this?

105
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:39,440
It’s Aunt Nee.

106
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:41,080
Don’t answer it.

107
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,840
But if you want to, just let me do the talking.

108
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:48,240
That would only make her more furious.

109
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,600
I’ll do it.

110
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:52,800
Then, put her on speaker so that I could help in case there’s anything.

111
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,280
Hello?

112
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:06,040
Where are you taking my niece?

113
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:09,480
What lies are you telling her to make her hate me?

114
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:13,400
You scumbag!

115
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:17,440
Ak didn’t fall for you so you’re going for my niece instead.

116
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,080
That’s enough, Aunt Nee.

117
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:27,200
Fai?

118
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,080
Is that you, dear?

119
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:32,919
What lies did that girl tell you?

120
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:35,200
Don’t listen to her.

121
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:38,640
You know how much I love you, don’t you?

122
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,679
I know.

123
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:43,200
And I love you too, Aunt Nee.

124
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:49,680
If you love me, then you should stay away from her, dear.

125
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,200
Aunt Nee.

126
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:57,280
You also hate her, don’t you?

127
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:08,440
Everything I did, I did it for you.

128
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:18,520
You’re the one who told me to find a way to get rid of her, remember?

129
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:26,960
Why are you mad at me now?

130
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,280
You have to be careful.

131
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:33,240
She’s nasty, you’re no match for her.

132
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:43,120
Get away from that filthy rat as fast as you can.

133
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,360
Hold on, Kaphrao. Listen to me first.

134
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:50,880
I can explain.

135
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:57,040
Save it. I’ve known since 15 years ago how much you hate me.

136
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:01,040
And now, I hate you a lot too!

137
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,400
Kaphrao!

138
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:09,920
Kaphrao, please listen to me. I can–

139
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:15,480
Kaphrao!

140
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:42,120
[♫Have you ever loved me? Please let me know…♫]

141
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:48,480
[♫If those hugs you gave me meant anything at all♫]

142
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:50,640
[♫I don’t want to imagine it alone. Do you also feel the same?♫]

143
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:52,640
You hate her too, don’t you?
[♫I don’t want to imagine it alone. Do you also feel the same?♫]

144
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:55,840
[♫I don’t want to imagine it alone. Do you also feel the same?♫]

145
00:10:55,840 --> 00:11:01,640
♫Forget about that promise and tell me honestly♫

146
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:05,920
♫If you’ve ever loved me at all♫

147
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:54,240
I really don’t know why Aunt Nee said that.

148
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,480
Now, Kaphrao thinks that I hate her.

149
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:07,080
Your aunt probably knew you put her on speaker.

150
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:10,000
She said it on purpose so Phrao would hear it.

151
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:12,640
To drive a wedge between you two.

152
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:17,280
I should go tell her about this then.

153
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,720
Hey, not yet.

154
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:22,280
Give her some time.

155
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:26,640
You’d only make things worse if you do it now.

156
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:30,480
Maybe you should wait until tomorrow.

157
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:34,600
Just sleep in my room tonight.

158
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:13,440
Miss Phrao refuses to come out of her room.

159
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:16,560
I tried to order something for her to eat but she said she’s not hungry.

160
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:19,480
She also said she has a headache and isn’t feeling well.

161
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:22,080
A headache?

162
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:23,680
Hey, calm down.

163
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,280
What now?

164
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,560
She’s still upset.

165
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:33,280
Just give her time.

166
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,400
She’ll come out when she feels better.

167
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,960
She has to eat somehow.

168
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:42,080
You can try making it up to her then.

169
00:13:43,280 --> 00:13:44,080
Really?

170
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:45,880
Yeah.

171
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:50,400
But I’ve never done anything like this before.

172
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:55,480
Din, help me.

173
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,720
Huh? Just like that?

174
00:13:57,800 --> 00:14:02,520
Well, you were quite an expert when you tried to make Boss Rose forgive you.

175
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:09,040
Please help her, honey.

176
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:15,680
Pleaseee.

177
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:18,440
- Please help me, Sis.
- Yeah, please help her.

178
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:22,520
Please, Sis.

179
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:24,320
Just help her, honey.

180
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:29,640
Anything to make Kaphrao feel better and talk to me.

181
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:35,880
So that I can explain about everything and…

182
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,560
confess to her.

183
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:46,320
A love confession?

184
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:56,600
We have to create a romantic vibe.

185
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:53,040
Let’s start then, shall we?

186
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,200
How’s the food?

187
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:30,640
It’s amazing.

188
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:37,000
If you want to eat anything, just go ahead and order it.

189
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:42,040
Thank you but I don’t have much appetite today.

190
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:03,840
Rose, should we play charades after this?

191
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:06,520
There are many of us today, it should be fun.

192
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,000
That's brilliant.

193
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:12,520
Miss Phrao, please join us.

194
00:17:14,079 --> 00:17:17,640
Well, I…

195
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:20,760
I…

196
00:17:21,839 --> 00:17:22,760
Please.

197
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:26,680
We don’t often get to be together like this.

198
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:29,960
I’m so fed up playing it with Din alone.

199
00:17:31,560 --> 00:17:33,040
Please, please, please.

200
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:35,680
Yes?

201
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,000
All right.

202
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:42,520
Riding a bike.

203
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:43,120
Sitting on a bike.

204
00:17:43,120 --> 00:17:44,600
- No, but there’s a word ‘bike’.
- A biker.

205
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:46,120
It’s an occupation.

206
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:47,560
Motorbike taxi?

207
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:48,480
That was close!

208
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:49,560
Motorbike taxi driver!

209
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:51,360
- That’s right!
- No ‘driver’ though.

210
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,560
Jack and Rose.

211
00:17:54,560 --> 00:17:55,440
Titanic!

212
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,240
What is it?

213
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,640
Do that again.

214
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:00,640
Mirroring?

215
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:03,640
A mirror?

216
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:12,640
- What is it?
- A ninja.

217
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:13,720
Dancing?

218
00:18:14,280 --> 00:18:15,480
A lion dance!

219
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:21,720
Squirrel.

220
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:23,680
Belly?

221
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:25,120
Doraemon.

222
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:28,120
No, not that! How could this be Doraemon?

223
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:29,840
A kangaroo!

224
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:31,040
Correct!

225
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,280
Fish.

226
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:37,000
Chest fish. Heart fish. Er…

227
00:18:38,040 --> 00:18:39,000
What is it?

228
00:18:39,280 --> 00:18:40,360
Climbing Perch fish! *(Pla Moh or physician fish in Thai)

229
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:41,760
Correct.

230
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:46,600
Carp fish! (*Carp/Krub - a polite ending word used by male speakers)

231
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:48,040
That’s right!

232
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:54,000
- A couple?
- Lovers?

233
00:18:57,400 --> 00:18:58,200
A fish?

234
00:18:58,880 --> 00:18:59,680
A fish?

235
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:01,680
Tuna?

236
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:08,440
Pisces? What is it?

237
00:19:26,320 --> 00:19:30,040
I’m having a headache. Please excuse me then. I’m sorry.

238
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:34,800
[Patongko] (*Youtiao or Chinese crullers)

239
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:13,880
This is it. She’s in a good mood right now.

240
00:20:25,800 --> 00:20:27,440
What are you waiting for?

241
00:20:27,720 --> 00:20:29,600
Do you want to miss this chance?

242
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:31,800
But what if she–

243
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:34,760
Geez, you dork! Just go.

244
00:20:34,880 --> 00:20:35,600
Go on.

245
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:36,840
Go!

246
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:50,720
Kaphrao.

247
00:20:52,600 --> 00:20:53,400
What?

248
00:20:57,200 --> 00:20:58,400
Can we talk?

249
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:02,640
Aren’t we talking now?

250
00:21:05,080 --> 00:21:05,880
Not like that.

251
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:10,360
Why are you avoiding me?

252
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:14,440
I’m not. I’m standing right in front of you.

253
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:20,520
Just hurry up and get it over with.

254
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:26,880
Well, I…

255
00:21:28,520 --> 00:21:29,400
I…

256
00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:32,480
I…

257
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,720
If you’re not going to say it, I will.

258
00:21:38,280 --> 00:21:41,840
Going back this time, I’ll tell Uncle that I’m going to work in Bangkok.

259
00:21:42,360 --> 00:21:44,400
I don’t want to cause your family any more trouble.

260
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:45,440
No, I won’t let you–

261
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:48,800
I’m not asking for your permission. I’m only letting you know.

262
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:55,240
About what Aunt Nee said, I can explain.

263
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:57,920
Honestly, I don’t hate you at all.

264
00:21:58,080 --> 00:21:59,600
Then, how do you feel about me?

265
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:03,480
I…

266
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:09,000
I…

267
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:16,840
Forget it. I don’t want to hear it anymore.

268
00:22:17,920 --> 00:22:19,560
Kaphrao! Wait.

269
00:22:19,800 --> 00:22:20,600
Don’t follow me.

270
00:23:12,080 --> 00:23:13,320
You’re terrible.

271
00:23:13,920 --> 00:23:17,320
If that’s the best you could do, don’t call me Boss anymore.

272
00:23:20,320 --> 00:23:23,640
A great humiliation to the Watinwanich family.

273
00:23:27,080 --> 00:23:28,760
But Kaphrao is…

274
00:23:29,080 --> 00:23:30,160
She’s what?

275
00:23:30,400 --> 00:23:33,360
Why can’t you just speak your mind like when you insulted her?

276
00:23:37,600 --> 00:23:43,240
I’m just afraid she might hate me even more if I say it.

277
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:47,440
But she already hates you anyway, doesn’t she?

278
00:23:47,880 --> 00:23:53,440
If it were me, I’d just say it. I don’t want to regret it later.

279
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:01,240
How should I confess to her then?

280
00:24:01,920 --> 00:24:03,600
I’ve never done it before.

281
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:11,040
Don’t worry. Leave that to the boss.

282
00:24:27,800 --> 00:24:29,480
It’s so nice and calm here.

283
00:24:32,880 --> 00:24:36,120
Din and I are planning to build a resort in Chiang Rai.

284
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:40,800
So, we came here in case we might be able to get some ideas.

285
00:24:43,200 --> 00:24:47,320
Please don’t forget to invite me once it’s done. I really want to see it.

286
00:24:48,800 --> 00:24:53,520
How could I forget? You’ll soon become a part of our family.

287
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:59,360
Was that supposed to be a joke, Miss Rose?

288
00:25:01,800 --> 00:25:02,600
Just kidding.

289
00:25:03,680 --> 00:25:05,240
But I’ll definitely invite you.

290
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:12,400
Yes, honey?

291
00:25:15,600 --> 00:25:22,280
Okay, sure. At the reception? I’ll be there shortly.

292
00:25:24,600 --> 00:25:26,120
I’ll be right back, Miss Phrao.

293
00:25:26,120 --> 00:25:29,720
Din just ran into the owner of this place, so she wants to introduce me to them.

294
00:25:30,280 --> 00:25:31,280
Please take your time.

295
00:25:31,800 --> 00:25:32,600
Okay.

296
00:25:48,520 --> 00:25:49,320
Kaphrao.

297
00:25:53,280 --> 00:25:55,240
Hold on, listen to me first.

298
00:25:55,880 --> 00:25:58,520
About what Aunt Nee said, I admit I used to say that.

299
00:25:58,520 --> 00:26:02,120
But it was long ago when I was still a kid. I actually don’t hate you.

300
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:12,840
I want to apologise for everything I’ve done.

301
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:16,000
I was wrong.

302
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:20,000
Never mind, it’s all in the past.

303
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:38,800
What?

304
00:26:40,880 --> 00:26:42,400
As an apology.

305
00:27:02,080 --> 00:27:05,440
Hey, I made it myself.

306
00:27:06,800 --> 00:27:11,040
You know I’ve never done this for anyone.

307
00:27:20,600 --> 00:27:21,400
Fine.

308
00:27:29,600 --> 00:27:31,200
I just don't want it to go to waste.

309
00:27:34,080 --> 00:27:37,640
I’m also sorry for saying I hate you earlier.

310
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:39,560
Then…

311
00:27:39,560 --> 00:27:42,640
Now that we’ve cleared it up, don’t forget to say thank you to Miss Rose.

312
00:27:44,080 --> 00:27:45,320
So, you knew?

313
00:27:52,080 --> 00:27:53,240
Hold on.

314
00:27:55,200 --> 00:27:56,200
There’s still one more thing.

315
00:27:57,320 --> 00:27:58,120
What now?

316
00:28:03,000 --> 00:28:04,400
It’s about your Phi Jah.

317
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:08,240
I might come later but I’m definitely not going to back down.

318
00:28:10,080 --> 00:28:13,560
Seriously, Fai, can we stop talking about that?

319
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:23,600
Fine, I’m going to say it my way then.

320
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:30,880
Kaphrao.

321
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:35,800
I like you.

322
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:41,520
I’ve liked you for a long time.

323
00:28:45,600 --> 00:28:48,360
You don’t have to answer me now. I can wait.

324
00:28:48,360 --> 00:28:53,040
♫What should I do? I can’t just let it go on like this♫

325
00:28:53,040 --> 00:28:58,920
♫But I’m too afraid to say it, so I’ll just keep it to myself♫

326
00:29:00,680 --> 00:29:04,760
♫I’ll just keep it to myself♫

327
00:29:30,400 --> 00:29:32,160
So, does she like me or not?

328
00:29:47,080 --> 00:29:48,120
I’m going crazy!

329
00:30:06,280 --> 00:30:07,360
[Fai]: Kaphrao.

330
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:10,640
I like you.

331
00:30:12,920 --> 00:30:15,480
♫I still remember vividly that day when we first met♫

332
00:30:15,480 --> 00:30:17,040
I’ve liked you for a long time.
♫I still remember vividly that day when we first met♫

333
00:30:17,040 --> 00:30:20,440
♫I still remember vividly that day when we first met♫

334
00:30:20,640 --> 00:30:21,040
♫Those memories we had together never fade away from my heart♫

335
00:30:21,040 --> 00:30:24,280
You don’t have to answer me now. I can wait.
♫Those memories we had together never fade away from my heart♫

336
00:30:24,280 --> 00:30:26,360
♫Those memories we had together never fade away from my heart♫

337
00:30:26,680 --> 00:30:34,200
♫We might never say it out loud how we feel for each other♫

338
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:39,920
♫But deep down we both know how we feel♫

339
00:30:39,920 --> 00:30:46,120
♫Those things in the past, I still can’t forget them♫

340
00:30:46,120 --> 00:30:52,200
♫I want to know if you’re like that too–do you also feel the same?♫

341
00:30:59,680 --> 00:31:00,840
Can’t sleep?

342
00:31:02,720 --> 00:31:05,640
Yeah, you too?

343
00:31:12,520 --> 00:31:13,800
Well, I…

344
00:31:14,720 --> 00:31:16,120
I won’t bother you then.

345
00:31:16,800 --> 00:31:17,840
Hold on.

346
00:31:23,720 --> 00:31:25,400
Please stay and talk to me first.

347
00:31:37,800 --> 00:31:41,280
Are you still mad at me because I said I like–

348
00:31:41,280 --> 00:31:42,360
No!

349
00:31:48,720 --> 00:31:51,880
So, do you hate me?

350
00:31:54,880 --> 00:31:56,040
No, I don’t.

351
00:31:57,640 --> 00:32:01,040
Why? Or do you want me to hate you?

352
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:09,400
I’m just afraid you might hate me because I told you how I feel.

353
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:24,040
About what you said, are you sure about it?

354
00:32:24,800 --> 00:32:25,600
I am!

355
00:32:30,600 --> 00:32:32,960
But we’ve never had a good time together.

356
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:37,200
We’ve always been fighting. How could you possibly like me?

357
00:32:37,280 --> 00:32:38,440
I don’t believe you.

358
00:32:40,800 --> 00:32:47,720
But for me, I like every moment I spend with you.

359
00:32:52,000 --> 00:32:53,880
How about we go to the mountain together?

360
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:57,480
To create our own happy moments.

361
00:33:02,600 --> 00:33:06,360
I’m not sure if Miss Din and Miss Rose are free though.

362
00:33:08,600 --> 00:33:10,240
It can just be the two of us.

363
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:13,840
If they’re also coming, how could we call it a date?

364
00:33:24,280 --> 00:33:28,560
Whatever. It’s either two of us alone,

365
00:33:29,800 --> 00:33:32,320
or else I’m not going.

366
00:33:34,280 --> 00:33:36,120
Don’t you want to go there with me?

367
00:33:47,280 --> 00:33:51,520
Of course, I do–so much too.

368
00:33:54,920 --> 00:33:59,040
♫ You’re the one that change my life ♫

369
00:33:59,760 --> 00:34:03,880
♫ Make me feel more important than anyone♫

370
00:34:03,880 --> 00:34:06,240
♫ Thank you so much♫

371
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:09,440
♫ For making my life meaningful♫

372
00:34:09,440 --> 00:34:15,639
♫ How lucky I am to have you♫

373
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:31,080
Thank you.

374
00:34:32,560 --> 00:34:37,880
Aww, there’re three of us here but you only top it up for her alone.

375
00:34:37,880 --> 00:34:39,480
How very caring of you.

376
00:34:40,679 --> 00:34:45,440
Come on. It’s me, your little sister.

377
00:34:47,480 --> 00:34:51,480
Yesterday at the creak, how was it, Miss Phrao?

378
00:34:56,199 --> 00:34:57,600
At the creak?

379
00:34:59,600 --> 00:35:02,400
It was fine. Good.

380
00:35:03,600 --> 00:35:04,560
Really good.

381
00:35:04,680 --> 00:35:06,000
Boss Rose.

382
00:35:10,320 --> 00:35:15,080
What about last night? Was it good, Fai?

383
00:35:18,280 --> 00:35:23,720
Last night? Sure, it was great.

384
00:35:25,680 --> 00:35:27,800
Aren’t you eating?

385
00:35:28,280 --> 00:35:32,240
Little Fireball, don’t you have anything to share with your sisters?

386
00:35:35,280 --> 00:35:36,440
Nope.

387
00:35:38,200 --> 00:35:39,640
Nothing at all.

388
00:35:43,080 --> 00:35:44,800
By the way, Din–

389
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:48,080
The mountain, right? I already booked a tent for you.

390
00:35:54,280 --> 00:35:55,400
Miss Phrao,

391
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:58,840
please do enjoy your moments there.

392
00:35:59,400 --> 00:36:04,360
Stargazing at night and waking up to the sea of fog in the morning.

393
00:36:06,000 --> 00:36:11,080
How romantic–an absolutely perfect place for a date.

394
00:36:12,200 --> 00:36:13,520
Not a date, Miss Rose.

395
00:36:14,720 --> 00:36:17,240
It’s hanging out. We’d just go hanging out there.

396
00:36:17,240 --> 00:36:18,400
- Hanging out?
- Yes.

397
00:36:20,320 --> 00:36:22,680
Yeah, hanging out.

398
00:36:24,080 --> 00:36:25,040
That’s right.

399
00:36:25,720 --> 00:36:26,680
Yeah.

400
00:36:27,320 --> 00:36:29,200
Just hanging out and looking around.

401
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:31,000
Looking around for love?

402
00:36:31,480 --> 00:36:35,640
We’re going camping. Didn’t you already book a tent for us?

403
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:38,240
Oh, that’s right. I did book it for you.

404
00:36:38,600 --> 00:36:42,240
The weather there is quite cold, you might want to sleep in each other’s arms.

405
00:36:44,480 --> 00:36:45,560
Boss Rose!

406
00:36:46,680 --> 00:36:47,800
Hugging.

407
00:36:47,840 --> 00:36:49,040
Stop talking nonsense.

408
00:36:49,480 --> 00:36:52,120
Isn’t the food nice? Have some more then.

409
00:36:52,200 --> 00:36:54,000
Here you go, my dear sis.

410
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:55,360
Thanks.

411
00:36:58,280 --> 00:36:59,640
So full of happiness, huh?

412
00:37:01,520 --> 00:37:03,200
It’s spilling out of my ears.

413
00:37:40,280 --> 00:37:41,560
What are you thinking?

414
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:48,080
I’m thinking about what I’ll have to face when I go home.

415
00:37:52,200 --> 00:37:53,400
Later then.

416
00:37:53,640 --> 00:37:58,480
For now, you should just let it go. Relax and recharge yourself

417
00:37:58,480 --> 00:38:00,440
so that you can fight the problem later.

418
00:38:06,080 --> 00:38:09,120
Do you really believe I could fix it?

419
00:38:13,720 --> 00:38:16,360
There’s always a solution to every problem.

420
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:18,960
Just never let go of each other’s hand.

421
00:38:25,280 --> 00:38:28,000
I still don’t know if she wants to hold my hand.

422
00:38:29,480 --> 00:38:32,120
She has never even said she likes me.

423
00:38:35,200 --> 00:38:41,480
Ever since I can remember, the Young Master that I know has never given on anything so easily.

424
00:38:42,400 --> 00:38:46,120
How come you’re so quick to give up when it comes to love?

425
00:38:46,520 --> 00:38:47,840
Are you really Fai?

426
00:38:50,080 --> 00:38:51,120
Well,

427
00:38:52,200 --> 00:38:55,200
if I were kind like you,

428
00:38:57,160 --> 00:39:01,720
calm like Nam, and sweet like Lom;

429
00:39:03,720 --> 00:39:06,200
maybe Kaphrao would like me more.

430
00:39:11,120 --> 00:39:14,440
Listen, you don’t need to try to be like anyone.

431
00:39:15,240 --> 00:39:18,400
Just be a better version of yourself, and that’s enough.

432
00:39:20,120 --> 00:39:25,200
If she’s going to like you, I’m sure she’ll like you as you are.

433
00:39:26,280 --> 00:39:27,080
Trust me.

434
00:39:34,280 --> 00:39:38,600
Geez, you’re so down bad for her.

435
00:39:38,880 --> 00:39:40,360
Are you Fai for real?

436
00:39:41,000 --> 00:39:42,160
Of course.

437
00:39:42,280 --> 00:39:44,480
Then how come you’re acting like a lovesick fool?

438
00:40:17,680 --> 00:40:19,200
It’s done.

439
00:40:20,520 --> 00:40:22,200
We should get the best view from this spot.

440
00:40:26,600 --> 00:40:27,840
Where’s the other tent?

441
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:30,680
I only brought one.

442
00:40:31,200 --> 00:40:34,040
What? Why did you only bring one?

443
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:39,000
The tent is huge. There’s plenty of room for two people. Look.

444
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:43,200
Are you scared?

445
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:50,680
I’m not going to do anything to you.

446
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:55,280
I just want to hang out with you, not to do that kind of thing.

447
00:40:56,280 --> 00:40:58,520
Try it and you’re dead.

448
00:41:00,200 --> 00:41:01,440
Ooh, I’m so scared.

449
00:41:08,080 --> 00:41:11,080
Hey, can you help me set up the chair and table?

450
00:41:13,880 --> 00:41:16,640
No, just do it yourself.

451
00:41:16,640 --> 00:41:18,080
I’ll go look around.

452
00:41:20,480 --> 00:41:24,320
Please, Phrao. Please help me.

453
00:41:27,280 --> 00:41:29,480
So that we could go for a walk together after this.

454
00:41:32,200 --> 00:41:35,720
Fine, I’ll help. But only because there’re just two of us here.

455
00:41:35,720 --> 00:41:37,560
Not that I’d want to go for a walk with you.

456
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:43,400
Where should I put it?

457
00:41:45,280 --> 00:41:48,120
Over there. Come.

458
00:42:15,000 --> 00:42:16,120
Sit down.

459
00:42:17,280 --> 00:42:18,840
The view is really nice.

460
00:42:57,880 --> 00:43:01,120
Miss Rose said the stars here look so beautiful at night.

461
00:43:01,520 --> 00:43:03,440
Do you think we’ll see them tonight?

462
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:08,840
Maybe or maybe not–it doesn’t matter though.

463
00:43:09,680 --> 00:43:11,480
We can come back anytime.

464
00:43:20,600 --> 00:43:25,560
From now on, can you call me ‘Phi’ (Big Sis) like when we were young?

465
00:43:28,000 --> 00:43:30,120
I’m going to call myself ‘Phi’ when I talk to you too.

466
00:43:33,080 --> 00:43:33,880
Why?

467
00:43:38,680 --> 00:43:40,760
I don’t want us to sound so distant.

468
00:43:42,720 --> 00:43:45,240
If I can’t be your lover, at least I can still be your sister.

469
00:43:49,120 --> 00:43:51,600
This is so weird. Are you someone else in disguise?

470
00:43:54,200 --> 00:43:56,720
I’m trying to be a better person here.

471
00:43:59,200 --> 00:44:05,960
Wouldn’t it be nice if I were as good as Din, Nam, or Lom?

472
00:44:09,120 --> 00:44:11,920
When I was little, I was always compared to them.

473
00:44:13,400 --> 00:44:15,680
I’ve never made my dad proud.

474
00:44:18,400 --> 00:44:22,600
So, I don’t know if you’d see anything good in me or even like me at all.

475
00:44:25,120 --> 00:44:29,720
When you like someone, it isn’t because they remind you of someone else.

476
00:44:30,800 --> 00:44:33,040
You like them as who they are.

477
00:44:37,600 --> 00:44:42,080
So, do you like me, Phrao?

478
00:44:57,280 --> 00:44:58,320
I’ll be back.

479
00:44:58,600 --> 00:44:59,400
Hold on.

480
00:45:07,600 --> 00:45:08,920
I don’t want to make you feel uncomfortable.

481
00:45:12,800 --> 00:45:13,680
So silly.

482
00:45:14,400 --> 00:45:16,800
I was quiet because I’m still thinking.

483
00:45:22,920 --> 00:45:26,240
But before I say it, can I ask you one thing?

484
00:45:27,920 --> 00:45:29,040
Go ahead.

485
00:45:32,640 --> 00:45:36,120
That day, 15 years ago,

486
00:45:37,600 --> 00:45:42,040
did you do that because you wanted me to disappear from your life forever?

487
00:46:01,880 --> 00:46:06,400
If I get first place in class, I’ll ask Uncle to buy me this plushie.

488
00:46:06,680 --> 00:46:07,800
Isn’t it cute?

489
00:46:08,200 --> 00:46:11,520
Do you really think someone like you could ever make it that far?

490
00:46:32,280 --> 00:46:33,480
This way.

491
00:46:36,080 --> 00:46:37,040
Put it in there.

492
00:46:50,280 --> 00:46:51,800
Uncle!

493
00:46:52,040 --> 00:46:53,240
Yes, dear?

494
00:46:54,520 --> 00:46:55,440
What is it?

495
00:46:55,440 --> 00:46:56,240
My exam result.

496
00:46:56,320 --> 00:46:57,880
Your exam result? Let me see.

497
00:47:01,000 --> 00:47:08,280
Wow! You passed all subjects. That’s brilliant, my girl.

498
00:47:09,160 --> 00:47:12,960
You deserve a reward then. How about an ice-cream?

499
00:47:12,960 --> 00:47:13,880
Do you like it?

500
00:47:14,840 --> 00:47:16,360
Well done!

501
00:47:17,760 --> 00:47:20,840
Fai, try to study like your sister.

502
00:47:21,200 --> 00:47:22,360
Understood?

503
00:47:23,720 --> 00:47:25,040
Come, let me see it again.

504
00:47:25,520 --> 00:47:27,080
What flavour do you want?

505
00:47:27,600 --> 00:47:28,240
Chocolate.

506
00:47:28,240 --> 00:47:29,200
Chocolate?

507
00:47:30,880 --> 00:47:33,240
Should we go this evening then?

508
00:47:33,840 --> 00:47:34,720
Chocolate.

509
00:47:36,880 --> 00:47:41,240
I can buy you a gift even if you didn’t get first place, dear.

510
00:47:42,000 --> 00:47:44,400
Here we are. This shop, isn’t it?

511
00:47:44,680 --> 00:47:45,720
Yes.

512
00:47:46,080 --> 00:47:47,720
Go on and pick one then.

513
00:47:57,600 --> 00:47:58,520
You want this one?

514
00:47:58,800 --> 00:47:59,480
Yes.

515
00:48:10,600 --> 00:48:14,120
You said you’d trust me. If you chicken out, then let’s not play.

516
00:48:14,640 --> 00:48:16,120
Fine, I’ll do it.

517
00:48:18,400 --> 00:48:19,680
Get in there then.

518
00:48:30,120 --> 00:48:34,080
1, 2, 3…

519
00:48:35,120 --> 00:48:36,120
Slowly.

520
00:48:37,280 --> 00:48:49,440
4,5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11…

521
00:49:12,280 --> 00:49:13,440
Uncle.

522
00:49:14,080 --> 00:49:14,880
Yes?

523
00:49:15,080 --> 00:49:17,280
Where’s the truck that was here earlier?

524
00:49:18,080 --> 00:49:20,240
It just left a while ago, Young Master.

525
00:50:12,480 --> 00:50:15,840
That day, I actually went back to get a plushie to surprise you.

526
00:50:19,200 --> 00:50:21,440
I know it sounds like an excuse to you.

527
00:50:26,280 --> 00:50:31,040
So, you’ve never wanted me to disappear from your life.

528
00:50:37,000 --> 00:50:38,360
No.

529
00:50:45,800 --> 00:50:46,800
I’m sorry.

530
00:50:49,000 --> 00:50:53,560
If I could turn back time, I wouldn’t have done that to you.

531
00:50:59,280 --> 00:51:03,240
Just knowing that you don’t hate me is more than enough.

532
00:51:08,680 --> 00:51:09,480
I don’t hate you.

533
00:51:12,280 --> 00:51:13,440
I like you.

534
00:51:33,480 --> 00:51:36,520
You should look at me when you say that.

535
00:51:39,280 --> 00:51:41,360
Are you teasing me?

536
00:51:42,920 --> 00:51:46,600
You used to tease me a lot. It’s my turn now.

537
00:52:06,600 --> 00:52:07,960
Phi Jah.

538
00:52:10,680 --> 00:52:15,080
So mean! Why calling someone else's name while hugging me?

539
00:52:17,000 --> 00:52:20,200
Stop being so silly, Phi Jah.

540
00:52:22,720 --> 00:52:23,600
Hang on.

541
00:52:24,760 --> 00:52:25,840
Phi Jah?

542
00:52:27,680 --> 00:52:29,960
Did you mean me?

543
00:52:30,800 --> 00:52:32,360
Of course, it’s you.

544
00:52:34,200 --> 00:52:35,240
Really?

545
00:52:36,120 --> 00:52:39,080
So, you’ve always liked me?

546
00:52:42,400 --> 00:52:45,160
If you still don’t get it, I don’t know what to say anymore.

547
00:52:50,000 --> 00:52:54,080
Phi Jah, you’re the luckiest girl in the world!

548
00:52:54,080 --> 00:52:55,640
Hey, keep your voice down!

549
00:53:00,600 --> 00:53:02,080
Phrao!

550
00:53:02,360 --> 00:53:06,960
♫I don’t know how to tell you how I feel♫

551
00:53:06,960 --> 00:53:07,600
♫I’m still confused by the way you react when I’m around♫

552
00:53:07,600 --> 00:53:10,640
My dear Phrao.
♫I’m still confused by the way you react when I’m around♫

553
00:53:10,640 --> 00:53:12,560
♫I’m still confused by the way you react when I’m around♫

554
00:53:12,560 --> 00:53:13,720
I’m so happy.
♫I’m still confused by the way you react when I’m around♫

555
00:53:13,720 --> 00:53:16,280
♫I’m still afraid. Will it be all right if I say it?♫

556
00:53:16,280 --> 00:53:17,840
Took you long enough.
♫I’m still afraid. Will it be all right if I say it?♫

557
00:53:18,440 --> 00:53:21,360
♫So I have to hide it inside♫

558
00:53:21,360 --> 00:53:23,520
♫I don’t know what to do with these feelings♫

559
00:53:23,520 --> 00:53:24,880
I almost died from stressing out.
♫I don’t know what to do with these feelings♫

560
00:53:24,880 --> 00:53:26,120
♫I don’t know what to do with these feelings♫

561
00:53:26,280 --> 00:53:28,040
I want you to figure it out for yourself.
♫Always keep dreaming of you, night after night♫

562
00:53:28,040 --> 00:53:30,920
♫Always keep dreaming of you, night after night♫

563
00:53:30,920 --> 00:53:33,040
I’m so happy that I’m your Phi Jah.
♫Always keep dreaming of you, night after night♫

564
00:53:33,040 --> 00:53:35,840
I’m so happy that I’m your Phi Jah.
♫What should I do? I can’t just let it go on like this♫

565
00:53:35,840 --> 00:53:37,640
♫What should I do? I can’t just let it go on like this♫

566
00:53:37,640 --> 00:53:39,800
♫But I’m too afraid to say it, so I’ll just keep it to myself♫

567
00:53:39,800 --> 00:53:42,120
Phi Jah, Phi Jah, Phi Jah, Phi Jah!
♫But I’m too afraid to say it, so I’ll just keep it to myself♫

568
00:53:42,120 --> 00:53:44,040
♫But I’m too afraid to say it, so I’ll just keep it to myself♫

569
00:53:45,520 --> 00:53:49,200
♫I’ll just keep it to myself♫

570
00:53:50,560 --> 00:53:55,480
♫I’ll just keep it to myself♫

571
00:54:29,800 --> 00:54:34,560
How could I sleep if you keep staring at me like that?

572
00:54:37,080 --> 00:54:42,840
I’m afraid you’ll disappear if I close my eyes and open them again.

573
00:54:45,000 --> 00:54:49,120
Where would I be then? I’m right next to you now.

574
00:54:52,200 --> 00:54:53,000
You’re right.

575
00:54:58,080 --> 00:54:58,880
Are you cold?

576
00:55:15,200 --> 00:55:16,120
Is it better?

577
00:55:23,200 --> 00:55:26,440
Can you move a little closer to me?

578
00:55:39,000 --> 00:55:39,800
Closer.

579
00:55:54,920 --> 00:55:56,080
So warm.

580
00:56:00,680 --> 00:56:02,080
The blanket can also keep you warm.

581
00:56:03,320 --> 00:56:05,000
Why do you need to hug me?

582
00:56:06,200 --> 00:56:08,400
Do you find it annoying?

583
00:56:10,400 --> 00:56:12,400
When we were young, yes.

584
00:56:13,440 --> 00:56:15,280
But not anymore.

585
00:56:17,480 --> 00:56:22,400
Does that mean you knew I secretly snuggled close to you?

586
00:57:07,000 --> 00:57:08,680
I’ve known all along.

587
00:57:10,480 --> 00:57:12,800
But you don’t need to do it secretly anymore.

588
00:57:14,080 --> 00:57:15,600
You have my permission now.

589
00:57:25,000 --> 00:57:26,240
Are you shy?

590
00:57:37,440 --> 00:57:42,760
Sleep now. Or else I’ll throw you out of the tent.

591
00:57:44,320 --> 00:57:46,040
Try it if you dare.

592
00:57:47,080 --> 00:57:48,000
No, I don’t.

593
00:57:51,400 --> 00:57:53,920
I won this time, Phi Jah.

594
00:57:56,400 --> 00:57:57,800
You’ve always won.

595
00:57:59,200 --> 00:58:01,240
I’ve just never let you know until now.

596
00:58:23,480 --> 00:58:29,080
Going back this time, I’m not going to let anyone hurt you again.

597
00:58:32,720 --> 00:58:35,400
Aunt Nee would probably do anything to break us apart.

598
00:58:36,480 --> 00:58:38,880
But I’ll never let go of your hand.

599
00:58:40,800 --> 00:58:43,840
I promise I’ll protect you as best as I can.

600
00:58:47,880 --> 00:58:52,120
I promise that no matter what happens,

601
00:58:52,800 --> 00:58:55,880
I’ll never let go of your hand too.

602
01:01:58,120 --> 01:01:59,240
Phrao.

603
01:02:00,240 --> 01:02:03,040
Wake up, baby. We’re home now.

604
01:02:09,000 --> 01:02:12,920
Why did you bring me here? Why didn’t you drop me off at the worker’s lodge first?

605
01:02:13,680 --> 01:02:15,680
I told Dad we’d be here.

606
01:02:16,200 --> 01:02:18,320
That I’d introduce my girlfriend to him.

607
01:02:18,320 --> 01:02:19,440
Phi Jah!

608
01:02:21,800 --> 01:02:24,280
Are you sure? Isn’t it too soon?

609
01:02:27,320 --> 01:02:30,640
Dad is also your guardian. I should do it the proper way.

610
01:02:30,960 --> 01:02:35,640
Remember what I told you, that I’ll never let Dad take you in as another daughter.

611
01:02:40,320 --> 01:02:43,960
I’d only allow you to be his daughter-in-law.

612
01:02:45,400 --> 01:02:46,280
I’m not going.

613
01:02:47,200 --> 01:02:49,160
You’re always like this.

614
01:02:49,400 --> 01:02:51,280
Take me back to the worker’s lodge.

615
01:02:54,880 --> 01:02:55,680
No.

616
01:02:56,520 --> 01:02:57,320
Ready?

617
01:03:13,280 --> 01:03:15,280
Kaphrao and I are together now.

618
01:03:16,400 --> 01:03:20,280
We just want to let you know that we’re seeing each other.

619
01:03:49,200 --> 01:03:50,240
That’s good.

620
01:03:51,000 --> 01:03:52,440
I’m happy for you.

621
01:03:53,480 --> 01:03:56,720
That’s it? You’re not gonna scold me?

622
01:03:57,680 --> 01:03:58,480
For what?

623
01:03:59,600 --> 01:04:01,760
It’s your happiness.

624
01:04:02,080 --> 01:04:03,840
Why would I disagree?

625
01:04:03,920 --> 01:04:07,320
Well, because I’m not a good girl.

626
01:04:09,080 --> 01:04:13,720
So, you might think I don’t deserve to be with her.

627
01:04:15,480 --> 01:04:16,720
Who told you that?

628
01:04:17,400 --> 01:04:20,080
I might not be a gentle parent to you,

629
01:04:21,200 --> 01:04:23,480
but I still know you well enough–

630
01:04:24,800 --> 01:04:26,720
that you’re far from being a bad person.

631
01:04:28,080 --> 01:04:33,760
On the other hand, no matter what people say about you,

632
01:04:36,080 --> 01:04:39,920
I’ve always loved and been proud of you.

633
01:04:41,520 --> 01:04:42,320
Dad.

634
01:04:48,400 --> 01:04:49,320
Also,

635
01:04:52,720 --> 01:04:58,960
I’ve always loved and cared for Kaphrao as if she were my own daughter.

636
01:04:59,000 --> 01:05:01,680
But from now on, she’s no longer your daughter.

637
01:05:02,480 --> 01:05:04,840
Huh? What would she be then?

638
01:05:05,480 --> 01:05:06,600
Your daughter-in-law.

639
01:05:06,600 --> 01:05:07,440
Fai!

640
01:05:08,520 --> 01:05:11,200
What are you saying? I haven’t agreed to it yet.

641
01:05:11,480 --> 01:05:15,440
Uncle, please don’t listen to her. She always loves to tease me.

642
01:05:15,480 --> 01:05:19,400
Eh, what uncle? Call me ‘Dad’, dear.

643
01:05:19,400 --> 01:05:20,480
Dad.

644
01:05:22,000 --> 01:05:23,480
She already approved.

645
01:05:24,040 --> 01:05:25,040
Not uncle.

646
01:05:35,280 --> 01:05:36,080
Uncle.

647
01:05:36,320 --> 01:05:37,240
It’s ‘Dad’.

648
01:05:39,400 --> 01:05:40,200
Dad.

649
01:05:43,680 --> 01:05:49,640
About moving into this house, can I just stay at the worker’s lodge like before?

650
01:05:50,400 --> 01:05:51,880
I don’t want to cause any trouble.

651
01:05:52,520 --> 01:05:53,520
But–

652
01:05:54,480 --> 01:05:56,400
Don’t worry, I’ll look after her.

653
01:05:57,400 --> 01:06:03,560
If she moves in now, I’m afraid Aunt Nee might…

654
01:06:06,600 --> 01:06:07,400
I understand.

655
01:06:08,400 --> 01:06:10,000
I’m also worried about that.

656
01:06:10,800 --> 01:06:14,440
If your aunt knows about this, she might have made another ruckus.

657
01:06:18,120 --> 01:06:20,200
But I have to tell her somehow.

658
01:06:21,280 --> 01:06:22,880
I’ve been avoiding it all this time.

659
01:06:24,480 --> 01:06:26,960
But I’m not going to run anymore.

660
01:06:29,480 --> 01:06:31,680
I promise to protect her.

661
01:06:33,320 --> 01:06:36,680
No matter what happens, I’ll always be by her side.

662
01:06:40,120 --> 01:06:42,200
I respect both of your decisions.

663
01:06:43,880 --> 01:06:45,200
And remember, girls–

664
01:06:47,120 --> 01:06:48,400
no matter what happens–

665
01:06:52,400 --> 01:06:55,280
I will always stand by you.

666
01:07:01,800 --> 01:07:08,680
Remember that.

667
01:07:18,680 --> 01:07:19,480
Dad!

668
01:07:35,320 --> 01:07:38,080
I thought you already forgot I’m still here.

669
01:07:45,600 --> 01:07:46,680
I’m sorry.

670
01:07:47,200 --> 01:07:48,600
Where have you been?

671
01:07:49,880 --> 01:07:53,760
It must have been fun since you’ve left me here for so many days.

672
01:07:55,120 --> 01:07:57,440
I just went to see Din. As for Kaphrao–

673
01:07:57,440 --> 01:08:02,280
Stop going anywhere with that girl. That’s an order!

674
01:08:04,120 --> 01:08:07,720
I don’t get it. Why do you hate her so much?

675
01:08:07,800 --> 01:08:09,880
Because she tries to seduce you!

676
01:08:10,480 --> 01:08:15,240
She’s playing with your heart. You’re too naive to see it.

677
01:08:15,320 --> 01:08:16,520
But I’m all grown up now.

678
01:08:16,920 --> 01:08:18,279
I can tell what’s what.

679
01:08:18,880 --> 01:08:20,439
Are you talking back to me?

680
01:08:22,680 --> 01:08:24,479
Since you’ve been with that girl,

681
01:08:25,479 --> 01:08:29,040
you’ve become so arrogant–not a sweet girl like you used to be.

682
01:08:31,680 --> 01:08:34,960
Aunt Nee, Kaphrao and I, we–

683
01:08:34,960 --> 01:08:36,080
I don’t care!

684
01:08:37,800 --> 01:08:41,920
If you choose me, there’s no her.

685
01:09:04,200 --> 01:09:05,439
Morning.

686
01:09:09,880 --> 01:09:10,680
Phi Jah!

687
01:09:14,000 --> 01:09:16,920
Fai, what are you doing here so early?

688
01:09:19,439 --> 01:09:23,200
Here, your breakfast. Eat up so you’ll have energy to work.

689
01:09:24,600 --> 01:09:25,560
Ahem!

690
01:09:27,040 --> 01:09:28,720
Aww.

691
01:09:29,920 --> 01:09:34,479
You two are so sweet it’s giving me diabetes just by looking.

692
01:09:35,600 --> 01:09:38,840
Aren’t you heading off to work? Hurry up then.

693
01:09:39,800 --> 01:09:40,600
Yes.

694
01:09:41,640 --> 01:09:42,399
Look,

695
01:09:43,560 --> 01:09:45,920
the other day you were still the Master’s adopted daughter.

696
01:09:45,920 --> 01:09:48,479
But now you’re his daughter-in-law.

697
01:09:48,479 --> 01:09:48,560
♫I still remember vividly that day when we first met♫

698
01:09:48,560 --> 01:09:49,439
Bua!

699
01:09:49,439 --> 01:09:50,640
♫I still remember vividly that day when we first met♫

700
01:09:50,640 --> 01:09:54,560
Just hurry out to work. And make sure your lips are sealed.

701
01:09:54,560 --> 01:09:55,000
♫I still remember vividly that day when we first met♫

702
01:09:55,000 --> 01:09:55,920
Go now.

703
01:09:55,920 --> 01:09:56,080
Okay.

704
01:09:56,080 --> 01:10:01,840
♫Those memories we had together never fade away from my heart♫

705
01:10:02,240 --> 01:10:02,320
♫We might never say it out loud how we feel for each other♫

706
01:10:02,320 --> 01:10:05,880
I’m leaving. I love my job, I love my job!

707
01:10:05,880 --> 01:10:09,840
♫We might never say it out loud how we feel for each other♫

708
01:10:09,840 --> 01:10:11,720
♫But deep down we both know how we feel♫

709
01:10:11,720 --> 01:10:14,680
This fried chicken is the best in town. It’s so delicious.

710
01:10:14,680 --> 01:10:14,880
♫But deep down we both know how we feel♫

711
01:10:14,880 --> 01:10:15,600
Aww, thank you.

712
01:10:15,600 --> 01:10:20,400
♫Those things in the past, I still can’t forget them♫

713
01:10:20,400 --> 01:10:21,520
Enjoy, you two.

714
01:10:21,520 --> 01:10:21,720
♫Those things in the past, I still can’t forget them♫

715
01:10:21,720 --> 01:10:22,280
♫I want to know if you’re like that too–do you also feel the same?♫

716
01:10:22,280 --> 01:10:22,920
Bua!

717
01:10:22,920 --> 01:10:23,240
♫I want to know if you’re like that too–do you also feel the same?♫

718
01:10:23,240 --> 01:10:24,040
Bye!

719
01:10:24,040 --> 01:10:26,680
♫I want to know if you’re like that too–do you also feel the same?♫

720
01:10:26,680 --> 01:10:28,200
Such a tease.

721
01:10:28,240 --> 01:10:35,800
♫I could never forget those eyes of yours♫

722
01:10:35,800 --> 01:10:42,240
♫The warmth you used to give me, I still remember it vividly♫

723
01:10:42,520 --> 01:10:49,600
♫No matter for how long, you’ll always remain in my heart♫

724
01:10:49,600 --> 01:10:58,680
♫All those years I’ve been waiting, for us to finally be together again♫

725
01:10:58,680 --> 01:11:00,880
How long are you going to keep staring at my face?

726
01:11:03,680 --> 01:11:07,280
I’m just admiring my own girlfriend. Can’t I do that?

727
01:11:08,040 --> 01:11:11,920
[North Star Entertainment]

728
01:11:11,920 --> 01:11:15,880
[Flaming Chains of Love]

729
01:11:15,880 --> 01:11:21,280
I’m sorry. I still couldn’t find a chance to tell Aunt Nee about us.

730
01:11:25,880 --> 01:11:28,280
I want to talk to you about that too.

731
01:11:30,800 --> 01:11:31,600
About what?

732
01:11:32,680 --> 01:11:36,200
It’s just…can we not tell other people about us yet?

733
01:11:37,720 --> 01:11:39,440
I don’t want any more trouble.

734
01:11:40,040 --> 01:11:42,240
Especially with your aunt.

735
01:11:44,600 --> 01:11:47,560
But I already promise I’ll protect you.

736
01:11:50,080 --> 01:11:55,560
Please give me some time. Pleaseee, Phi Jah.

737
01:11:55,960 --> 01:12:00,200
Let’s wait until the situation clears up.

738
01:12:00,200 --> 01:12:03,160
Please, pleaseee.

739
01:12:03,160 --> 01:12:04,400
Okay, fine.

740
01:12:05,000 --> 01:12:06,440
Is that all?

741
01:12:09,000 --> 01:12:10,000
There’s more.

742
01:12:12,480 --> 01:12:18,040
In front of other people, you must treat me like before.

743
01:12:18,280 --> 01:12:22,080
Before? How?

744
01:12:23,200 --> 01:12:26,840
Like those times when we could hardly stand each other.

745
01:12:28,480 --> 01:12:30,720
You want me to pretend to hate you?

746
01:12:33,680 --> 01:12:35,080
Please.

747
01:12:35,080 --> 01:12:37,280
Can you do it for me, Phi Jah?

748
01:12:38,400 --> 01:12:39,200
Please?

749
01:12:41,400 --> 01:12:47,360
Just putting on an act to fool other people for a bit.

750
01:12:47,360 --> 01:12:50,320
This much, only this much.

751
01:12:50,320 --> 01:12:52,800
Please, pleaseee.

752
01:12:52,800 --> 01:12:53,960
All right, all right.

753
01:12:55,200 --> 01:12:57,920
But only when we’re in front of other people.

754
01:12:58,400 --> 01:12:59,240
Yes.

755
01:12:59,640 --> 01:13:02,680
You’re the sweetest, Phi Jah!

756
01:13:06,200 --> 01:13:08,080
Do you love me then?

757
01:13:11,680 --> 01:13:13,240
You’re getting bolder.

758
01:13:15,000 --> 01:13:16,000
I’m going to eat.

759
01:13:16,200 --> 01:13:17,600
Answer me first.

760
01:13:17,680 --> 01:13:19,800
- Eat first.
- Tell me first.

761
01:13:19,800 --> 01:13:22,000
- No, eat first.
- Do you love me?

762
01:13:24,280 --> 01:13:25,080
Not telling you.

763
01:13:26,800 --> 01:13:28,000
Then, I won’t eat.

764
01:13:28,280 --> 01:13:29,760
Come on, Fai.

765
01:13:29,920 --> 01:13:30,840
Do you love me?

766
01:13:31,200 --> 01:13:35,120
Phi Jah, you already know how I feel. Hurry and eat your breakfast.

767
01:13:35,200 --> 01:13:36,000
No, I don’t!

768
01:13:45,600 --> 01:13:48,480
These are all the works you were supposed to do while you were away.

769
01:13:49,200 --> 01:13:54,440
Get them done by today so other people won’t have to wait for you only.

770
01:13:55,200 --> 01:13:56,600
But that’s a lot there.

771
01:13:56,600 --> 01:13:59,920
So? You need to finish them anyway.

772
01:14:00,320 --> 01:14:03,400
Or do you want me to tell Young Master?

773
01:14:06,800 --> 01:14:08,200
Is that all?

774
01:14:11,880 --> 01:14:13,400
I thought there’s more.

775
01:14:15,680 --> 01:14:17,760
Just give her some reprimand, Young Master.

776
01:14:22,080 --> 01:14:23,480
Quit slacking off and work faster!

777
01:14:31,400 --> 01:14:33,720
And who told you to dump all the works on Athittaya?

778
01:14:38,280 --> 01:14:42,760
Well, I just want to help you lighten the workload.

779
01:14:44,080 --> 01:14:45,720
All of you, listen carefully.

780
01:14:46,040 --> 01:14:50,040
From now on, if anyone wants to assign work to my assistant, you must get my approval first.

781
01:14:50,040 --> 01:14:51,240
Understood?

782
01:14:53,080 --> 01:14:53,880
Yes, Miss.

783
01:14:55,800 --> 01:14:59,080
As for you, you need to be responsible for your mistakes.

784
01:14:59,400 --> 01:15:01,800
Follow me to my office right now!

785
01:15:17,600 --> 01:15:20,760
Hey, did you see her face?

786
01:15:20,760 --> 01:15:24,320
As if she saw a ghost, right?

787
01:15:41,680 --> 01:15:44,960
There, there. It’s all right, my baby.

788
01:15:45,200 --> 01:15:48,680
How dare Duangnate try to bully my girlfriend like that?

789
01:15:48,680 --> 01:15:50,480
Should I just cut down her pay?

790
01:15:51,720 --> 01:15:55,040
Who do you think told her to bully me?

791
01:16:00,080 --> 01:16:00,880
Me.

792
01:16:02,880 --> 01:16:05,120
Phi Jah is nasty! Phi Jah is a bad girl!

793
01:16:05,120 --> 01:16:06,880
Phi Jah caused you trouble…

794
01:16:07,400 --> 01:16:10,680
Aww, you were so scary back there.

795
01:16:18,600 --> 01:16:20,960
Let’s go eat with Dad at the main house this evening.

796
01:16:22,200 --> 01:16:24,800
Don’t you have to go eat with your aunt?

797
01:16:26,600 --> 01:16:28,640
I’m staying at the main house for now.

798
01:16:29,520 --> 01:16:31,720
Auntie’s house hasn't been quite welcoming lately.

799
01:16:34,080 --> 01:16:38,080
I’m so sorry I’ve caused you trouble.

800
01:16:38,880 --> 01:16:40,400
I don’t want you and Aunt Nee–

801
01:16:43,080 --> 01:16:44,800
It’s not your fault at all.

802
01:16:46,600 --> 01:16:47,600
I can handle it.

803
01:16:52,080 --> 01:16:54,400
All I need is for you to always be by my side.

804
01:17:01,080 --> 01:17:03,320
But I’m feeling so drained right now.

805
01:17:04,880 --> 01:17:07,040
Can you cheer me up a bit?

806
01:17:12,480 --> 01:17:13,640
You can do it!

807
01:17:14,080 --> 01:17:17,880
Nooo, not like that.

808
01:17:18,320 --> 01:17:19,280
How do you want it?

809
01:17:23,680 --> 01:17:26,600
Ahh, so sweet.

810
01:17:26,600 --> 01:17:29,640
Phi Jah, don’t do that! We’re in the office!

811
01:17:29,640 --> 01:17:31,200
Did you just hit me? I’ll punish you then.

812
01:17:32,800 --> 01:17:36,000
Stop it. I’m going back to work.

813
01:17:36,800 --> 01:17:38,920
Are you embarrassed, huh?

814
01:17:39,280 --> 01:17:41,680
Do you still know the way back to your desk?

815
01:17:42,320 --> 01:17:43,920
Want me to walk you there?

816
01:17:45,520 --> 01:17:46,480
I’m not embarrassed.

817
01:17:53,600 --> 01:17:55,040
Holy shit!

818
01:17:58,200 --> 01:18:00,320
I’m sorry. I didn’t see anything.

819
01:18:00,320 --> 01:18:02,280
I didn’t see you and Miss Phrao kissing.

820
01:18:02,880 --> 01:18:03,840
We weren’t kissing!

821
01:18:05,400 --> 01:18:08,560
I swear I won’t tell anyone.

822
01:18:26,920 --> 01:18:29,080
Come on, Phrao.

823
01:18:29,400 --> 01:18:32,240
I don’t want to work there anymore. I want to quit!

824
01:18:32,640 --> 01:18:35,480
I’m sorry. I forgot to lock the door.

825
01:18:36,560 --> 01:18:38,040
Stop it.

826
01:18:42,080 --> 01:18:45,160
Listen, if you want to quit, then go ahead.

827
01:18:45,480 --> 01:18:46,640
I can take care of you.

828
01:18:47,200 --> 01:18:52,080
Phi Jah, stop joking around! What if your aunt hears about this?

829
01:18:52,520 --> 01:18:54,280
She hasn’t heard about it yet.

830
01:18:54,480 --> 01:18:55,640
You nasty bitch!

831
01:19:00,320 --> 01:19:01,360
Phi Jah!

832
01:19:03,320 --> 01:19:04,120
Fai…

833
01:19:05,400 --> 01:19:07,480
Get out the way, dear. Move!

834
01:19:07,480 --> 01:19:10,360
Out of the way! Move, Fai! Let me go!

835
01:19:10,360 --> 01:19:11,520
No!

836
01:19:15,600 --> 01:19:19,800
How dare you try to seduce my niece even at work?

837
01:19:20,200 --> 01:19:22,240
No one is doing that.

838
01:19:22,720 --> 01:19:24,120
Are you defending her?

839
01:19:25,880 --> 01:19:27,760
When will you stop being so obsessed?

840
01:19:28,000 --> 01:19:28,880
I’m not obsessed.

841
01:19:29,680 --> 01:19:32,400
And I don’t hate her like how you’ve always wanted me to.

842
01:19:33,000 --> 01:19:35,320
How dare you talk to me like that?

843
01:19:36,280 --> 01:19:38,520
You know how much I hate her!

844
01:19:38,520 --> 01:19:40,200
But I love her!

845
01:19:44,000 --> 01:19:45,320
I love Phrao.

846
01:19:46,280 --> 01:19:47,840
I’ve loved her all along.

847
01:20:15,880 --> 01:20:17,680
Aunt Nee!

848
01:20:20,200 --> 01:20:21,400
Aunt Nee!

849
01:20:21,680 --> 01:20:22,480
Aunt Nee!

850
01:20:23,680 --> 01:20:25,000
Aunt Nee!

851
01:20:25,120 --> 01:20:25,920
Aunt Nee!

852
01:20:26,680 --> 01:20:27,480
Aunt Nee!

853
01:20:28,400 --> 01:20:29,760
Aunt Nee!

854
01:20:30,480 --> 01:20:31,720
Aunt Nee!

855
01:20:38,320 --> 01:20:40,280
Phrao, call an ambulance!

856
01:20:42,400 --> 01:20:43,200
Aunt Nee!

857
01:20:45,600 --> 01:20:46,400
Aunt Nee!

858
01:20:49,280 --> 01:20:50,080
Aunt Nee!

859
01:20:52,280 --> 01:20:54,120
Wake up, Aunt Nee!

860
01:20:56,320 --> 01:20:57,920
Aunt Nee!

861
01:21:05,080 --> 01:21:06,640
Aunt Nee!

862
01:21:08,040 --> 01:21:09,120
Aunt Nee!

863
01:21:10,040 --> 01:21:11,360
Aunt Nee!

864
01:21:33,680 --> 01:21:38,640
[Next Episode]
Phi Jah, if you ever have to choose, please choose Miss Panee.

865
01:21:38,640 --> 01:21:40,480
I’m not going to choose anyone.

866
01:21:41,040 --> 01:21:44,560
But what if one day, you have to make a choice.

867
01:21:45,760 --> 01:21:47,640
Get her out of my face.

868
01:21:47,640 --> 01:21:49,040
Aunt Nee.

869
01:21:49,440 --> 01:21:50,800
I said get out!

870
01:21:52,040 --> 01:21:55,680
Are you going to leave me for someone who’s just come into your life?

871
01:21:55,680 --> 01:22:02,160
The doctor suggests we should separate her from whatever that arouses her to be like this.

872
01:22:04,160 --> 01:22:05,480
And that’s Kaphrao.
